{"name": "Possessed Kingdom", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/401ed8d20b93b129631f70dbf471b332.webp?t=1786379817\" height=\"211\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/401ed8d20b93b129631f70dbf471b332.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"652\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/fcdd99130983ef4efe98a5c01d60442b.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/fcdd99130983ef4efe98a5c01d60442b.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/fcdd99130983ef4efe98a5c01d60442b.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No more units getting stuck on walls. <strong>You</strong> control the exact route.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bypass Defenses:</strong> Draw a line to sneak past tanky towers and hit their weak economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Flanking:</strong> Split your forces by drawing two pincer movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Timing Pushes:</strong> Funnel your army into a single death ball to break their line.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/d1ec573b84142ccea7548818b93f32bb.webp?t=1786379817\" height=\"211\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/d1ec573b84142ccea7548818b93f32bb.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"652\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/06eb17ba68d9a8c1b67e84f38560e58f.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/06eb17ba68d9a8c1b67e84f38560e58f.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/06eb17ba68d9a8c1b67e84f38560e58f.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Economy:</strong> Play cards to generate gold per round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise an Army:</strong> Construct Barracks to train troops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Siege the Enemy:</strong> Create a physical path for your troops to bypass defenses and destroy the enemy base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot the Deck:</strong> Upon victory, steal 3 cards from the enemy's deck to power up for the next battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/caca289521129c3968d79c5951bfd702.webp?t=1786379817\" height=\"211\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/caca289521129c3968d79c5951bfd702.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"652\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/7edcc61b25c2cd3344ebb4064838a450.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/7edcc61b25c2cd3344ebb4064838a450.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/7edcc61b25c2cd3344ebb4064838a450.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating an enemy isn't just a win; it's a robbery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot the Deck:</strong> Upon victory, <strong>steal cards</strong> from the enemy to power up your own deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck Size Management:</strong> You have limited deck space. Do you steal powerful cards for immediate power, or buy more Deck Size to scale for the late game?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Counter-Pick:</strong> Read the enemy playstyle (Aggressive, Economic, Defensive) before the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reroll:</strong> Don't like the enemy match-up? <strong>Reroll</strong> their playstyle to find an opening\u2014but choose wisely. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras_big/3b0cdce23fd47db797ee5eda2e6f9ada.webp?t=1786379817\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/3b0cdce23fd47db797ee5eda2e6f9ada.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"652\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/f2cb2f45d31b0d9f4a5d71b47b61f1c3.poster.avif?t=1786379817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/f2cb2f45d31b0d9f4a5d71b47b61f1c3.webm?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/extras/f2cb2f45d31b0d9f4a5d71b47b61f1c3.mp4?t=1786379817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For those who want to suffer.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat all your enemies to unlock <strong>the next Ascension Level</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Efficiency</strong> is the only way to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Defend your kingdom or rush the enemy in this Deckbuilding RTS. Build your base, scale your economy, and draw custom paths for your troops to break enemy defenses. Win battles, steal the king's cards, and build the ultimate deck.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254920/04076c2f05eb4eff8e409e66d9c09c8463d55757/header.jpg?t=1786379817", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Base Building", "Strategy", "Tactical", "Building", "Fantasy"], "developers": "Pipa Studios", "publishers": "Pipa Studios", "release_date": "Oct 26, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4254920", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/YTQa1fXwON8", "first_seen": 1785196800.0, "review_rank": 197}